  "ID": "34712",
  "post_title": "La vida es un carnaval...en Onda y Suera",
  "post_date": "2013-02-24 12:51:47",
  "post_name": "la-vida-es-un-carnaval-en-onda-y-suera",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>Miles de personas acabaron confluyendo este s&aacute;bado desde la Font de Dins a la carpa del recinto multiusos de Onda, en el carnaval organizado por Sonora.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/02/IMG_7942.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Este a&ntilde;o ha coincidido con el de Suera, organizado por el Centre Cultural, en el que result&oacute;&nbsp;ganadora de grupo la pe&ntilde;a de chicas que llevaban el disfraz de magdalena.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/02/IMG_7939.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El mejor disfraz individual de Suera fue&nbsp;el de&nbsp;Jordi Fausto Serrano.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnavalondasuera13/img_7719.jpg\" alt=\"img_7719\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnavalondasuera13/img_7720.jpg\" alt=\"img_7720\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnavalondasuera13/img_7721.jpg\" alt=\"img_7721\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnavalondasuera13/img_7722.jpg\" alt=\"img_7722\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnavalondasuera13/img_7723.jpg\" alt=\"img_7723\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnavalondasuera13/img_7724.jpg\" alt=\"img_7724\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnavalondasuera13/img_7725.jpg\" alt=\"img_7725\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnav